title: Political Direction
subtitle: How PPS builds its influence.
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: party_affairs
card-image: img/poster_2.jpg
view-if: {! return !!Q.S && !!Q.polish_party_rules && PolishParty.stanceAvailable(Q, 'direction') !}
on-arrival: {!
// Card party.direction (catalogue 4.1; technical reference 10.5–10.6): 1 T, 0 R, the card then waits 6 months. The present line is shown and cannot be
// chosen again; closing the card is free (Z — 0.32).
PolishParty.stanceView(Q, 'direction');
!}

= Political Direction

The present line: **[+ pl_stance_current +]**. A new declaration costs this month's action; it changes no law in force and gives no reform by itself.

- @parliamentary_socialism
- @class_independence
- @workers_gains
- @democratic_movement
- @easy_discard

@parliamentary_socialism
title: Parliamentary socialism
subtitle: A parliamentary campaign gains ×1.10 while a PPS bill is before the chambers.
choose-if: {! return PolishParty.stanceStatus(Q, 'direction', 'parliamentary_socialism').available !}
unavailable-subtitle: [+ pl_stance_parliamentary_socialism_why +]
on-arrival: {!
PolishParty.stanceChoose(Q, 'direction', 'parliamentary_socialism');
!}
go-to: result

@class_independence
title: Independent class politics
subtitle: A class campaign gains ×1.10. Alliances stay possible, but a joint list against a public promise needs renegotiation.
choose-if: {! return PolishParty.stanceStatus(Q, 'direction', 'class_independence').available !}
unavailable-subtitle: [+ pl_stance_class_independence_why +]
on-arrival: {!
PolishParty.stanceChoose(Q, 'direction', 'class_independence');
!}
go-to: result

@workers_gains
title: Defend the workers’ gains
subtitle: A campaign for the workers’ gains ×1.10 while a protection or the inspection works, ×1.15 when a cut is on the table.
choose-if: {! return PolishParty.stanceStatus(Q, 'direction', 'workers_gains').available !}
unavailable-subtitle: [+ pl_stance_workers_gains_why +]
on-arrival: {!
PolishParty.stanceChoose(Q, 'direction', 'workers_gains');
!}
go-to: result

@democratic_movement
title: A broad democratic movement
subtitle: A democracy campaign ×1.00 without a threat, ×1.15 under a threat to democracy.
choose-if: {! return PolishParty.stanceStatus(Q, 'direction', 'democratic_movement').available !}
unavailable-subtitle: [+ pl_stance_democratic_movement_why +]
on-arrival: {!
PolishParty.stanceChoose(Q, 'direction', 'democratic_movement');
!}
go-to: result

@result
new-page: true

